WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Create an Integrations Hub. Open Embeddings and choose Integrations Hub. Borrower Verification is not selectable.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Name the configuration. Use the left panel for integrations, the middle for preview and the right panel for appearance.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Filter and search the provider catalog. Choose ALL, US or CA, then search for a provider. Filtering does not remove integrations already selected.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Review the enabled integrations. This example offers Stripe, Square and QuickBooks Online. Selected shows what borrowers will be offered.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Preview one provider choice per category. In desktop preview, choosing Square replaces Stripe for the Payments step. A choice does not connect an account.

6
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Move to the next category. Accounting is a separate step with its own provider choice. Appearance settings apply across the preview.

7
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Save the configuration. The name, integration selection and appearance are saved together as a versioned configuration.

8
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Open the saved embedding record. The drawer shows the configuration and version identifiers for the selected workspace environment.

9
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Use the version when creating a session. Your server creates an embedding session with this version. Existing borrower sessions keep their original version.
